{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-24T13:25:49.593Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary:\n\n**Implemented** (all within scope):\n- `src/program.ts` — `buildProgram` now takes optional `runtime`/`clock`, builds one `CommandContext`, and registers `deploy`, `status`, `logs`, `stop`.\n- `src/commands/deploy.ts` — runs inside `withEngine`, applies `--image` first, streams `<status>: <message>` progress (suppressed with `--json`), prints the running line/record, and on failure prints `  | <line>` for further error lines then throws `deployment <id> failed: <first line>`.\n- `src/commands/status.ts` — store-only overview table/JSON, uptime from the `running` status change, and the one-app overview + five newest deployments table/JSON.\n- `src/commands/logs.ts` — `withEngine`, `--tail`/`--since` validation, running-deployment lookup, stdout/stderr routing and JSON entries.\n- `src/commands/stop.ts` — `stopApp` inside `withEngine`, prints `stopped <app> (deployment <id>)`.\n\n**Tests** (new): `tests/deploy-cli.test.ts` and `tests/status-logs-cli.test.ts` cover every acceptance line.\n\n**Verify**: task command (`31 pass`) and proposal `pnpm verify` (`195 pass`) both pass.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/006-deploy-cli/.run/results/2.md`."}}
